**Stack (Scenario 2)**: React 18 + TypeScript + **Vite** (frontend); **Node.js** +
**Express** + TypeScript + Zod (backend). Vitest in both packages. HTTP polling ~2s
(lobby + game); in-memory `roomStore` with viewer-filtered snapshots. No WebSockets,
DB, or auth. Drawer-only `secretWord`; deterministic word from `STARTER_WORDS`.
